# Frontend (Vite) — optional. The app runs in simulation mode with no configuration.
# Where the dev server proxies /api (the FastAPI Ring adapter):
# THRESHOLD_BACKEND_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787

# Production builds (the Vercel deploy) are static and use the in-browser Ring
# simulator. To connect a deployed backend instead, set its public URL at build
# time and add the site origin to THRESHOLD_CORS_ORIGINS on the server:
# VITE_THRESHOLD_API_BASE=https://threshold-api.example.com

# Ring credentials and the webhook signing key belong to the BACKEND only:
# copy server/.env.example to server/.env. Never put secrets in frontend env files.
